(text "NEPAMesh LoraSupermini v0.1  -  nRF52840 supermini + Seeed Wio-SX1262 carrier, 18650 off-board" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f46618ae-bc64-5a1e-bdbf-ebcde899107b"))
(text "J1: JST-PH battery, pin 1 = +. Check your lead's polarity - many 18650 holders are wired backwards." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8803346c-0dac-50fd-85d7-0ca1b2a54867"))
(text "Q1 blocks reversed battery. JP1 ties B- to GND; cut it if a meter shows B- is not GND on your clone." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b0f66b58-5179-5825-9137-5f5012c91ba0"))
(text "RF_SW (RXEN): drive HIGH for RX, LOW otherwise; TX is switched by SX1262 DIO2 inside the module. DIO3 = TCXO supply." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 120 185 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8097af4d-6bb5-5bf6-9a5f-84e01be443e6"))
(text "Wio pin 9 (ANT) is only populated on the -N SMT-pin variant; unused with the IPEX 114993390." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 120 190 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c10172a1-79cd-5e10-adeb-61665e595e1e"))
